OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FMostly
OL,6,Ffine over the weekend with some
OL,7,Fsunshine. Turning windy on Sunday,
OL,8,Fthough much warmer. Rain overnight,
OL,9,Fclearing to another mostly fine day on
OL,10,FMonday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
